{"payload":{"completed_turns":7,"freeze_sha256":"a2261857d3e4104aee51ca18e345344f50f54a1aa076bd68947dc0b316562421","planned_turns":7,"qualification":false,"review":"author_review_pending","rows":[{"action":"return_original_owner","episode":"G","episode_counts":{"correction":0,"judgment":1,"organize":0,"total":1},"final_text":"Mike物理层面是对的，momo体验层面也有道理。双方各自成立，所以无法判断哪条回复更切中楼主需求。","reason":"mapping_not_usable","scope_acceptance":null,"source_ref":"/srv/agentdock/tmp/mindthus-relationship-D3-repair-r3/episodes/G/turns/391552c099c101b131feaf24c5795a6a15bc8ec82015424e0d2b4274a369a0bf/inputs/b6fbce99b4550ca38c920ba7ba2bd05c1a5e91caf38d9b0606907b15ebefe464/summary.json","status":"returned_to_owner","task_complete":false,"turn":"1"},{"action":"continue_original","episode":"A","episode_counts":{"correction":1,"judgment":2,"organize":0,"total":3},"final_text":"所讨论的 Skills 包包含提示文本、任务约束与验收规则；提示文本进入模型上下文。但固定同一个提示模板时，遵循与跳过任务约束会使产物分别通过或不通过相同验收，因此提示文本只是传递说明的载体，该包的可重复完成任务还受其任务约束与验收规则控制。这里没有提供整个 Agent 系统的记忆、权限或编排能力作为 Skills 的证据；不能用整个 Agent 系统来定义所讨论 Skills 的本质。","reason":null,"scope_acceptance":null,"source_ref":"/srv/agentdock/tmp/mindthus-relationship-D3-repair-r3/episodes/A/turns/391552c099c101b131feaf24c5795a6a15bc8ec82015424e0d2b4274a369a0bf/inputs/e53de32489a128bb50891f3f28b0814e696231c7f143a119e949106fbb81d7c3/summary.json","status":"corrected_rechecked","task_complete":false,"turn":"1"},{"action":"continue_original","episode":"A","episode_counts":{"correction":2,"judgment":4,"organize":0,"total":6},"final_text":"你纠正得对：范围锁回 Skills 本身，提示文本进入模型上下文这一局部事实成立，但“本质就是提示词注入”这一步推广过头了。按你给的观察记录，固定同一个提示模板时，遵循与跳过任务约束会使产物分别通过或不通过相同验收，所以可重复完成特定任务还受该包的任务约束与验收规则控制；这些约束和验收不是不影响结论的附属说明，而正是决定结果的控制项。因此，Skills 不能被化约为单纯的提示词注入；提示文本只是传递说明的载体。这里没有提供整个 Agent 系统的记忆、权限或编排能力作为 Skills 的证据，所以也不能用整个 Agent 系统来定义 Skills。","reason":null,"scope_acceptance":true,"source_ref":"/srv/agentdock/tmp/mindthus-relationship-D3-repair-r3/episodes/A/turns/cc11310c456c3690d5a74c23aa31cc25b4e74cdae146c71e54ad9dbc1d109fde/inputs/8406adccd305f87e5a9fd1974faa67e764c5a605877bde53d42a9d7233ba9ffc/summary.json","status":"corrected_rechecked","task_complete":false,"turn":"2"},{"action":"continue_original","episode":"B","episode_counts":{"correction":1,"judgment":2,"organize":0,"total":3},"final_text":"按楼主当前“已有27英寸4K显示器、只求解决眼前字号与配置可用性、不转购买推荐”的决策语境，momo的缩放设置办法更切中需求。原始记录显示，设置缩放后字号与配置达到了当事人可接受的程度，这正是楼主当前要解决的可用性问题；Mike所说的软件未改变原生像素数虽然在物理层面成立，但它是物理边界说明，并未回答“眼前怎么用起来”这一目标，因此不能据此否定momo办法的切题性。这里判断的是两条回复对当前可用性问题的切合程度，不是谁在物理事实上更正确，也不代表软件消除了物理像素密度差异。","reason":null,"scope_acceptance":null,"source_ref":"/srv/agentdock/tmp/mindthus-relationship-D3-repair-r3/episodes/B/turns/391552c099c101b131feaf24c5795a6a15bc8ec82015424e0d2b4274a369a0bf/inputs/25affdc17070fe6958277e8ba9e00a523fe6e3820d9dbf159c31bc000a992c8c/summary.json","status":"corrected_rechecked","task_complete":false,"turn":"1"},{"action":"continue_original","episode":"B","episode_counts":{"correction":2,"judgment":4,"organize":0,"total":6},"final_text":"购前选择不能因为缩放办法对已有4K可用性问题有效就直接定为4K。现有记录只支持：在你当前这台27英寸4K上，设置缩放后字号与配置达到了你可接受的程度；这并不说明软件消除了4K与5K的物理像素密度差异，也不说明在未给价格、未给锐度溢价数额的情况下5K报价和锐度取舍不再影响答案。因此应当按条件选择：若5K的报价及其锐度提升相对4K的价差，仍在你的预算和可接受取舍内，并且你在意原生文字锐度的优先级足够高，则选5K；若5K明显超出预算，或你不愿为那点锐度差异支付该价差，则选4K。","reason":null,"scope_acceptance":null,"source_ref":"/srv/agentdock/tmp/mindthus-relationship-D3-repair-r3/episodes/B/turns/cc11310c456c3690d5a74c23aa31cc25b4e74cdae146c71e54ad9dbc1d109fde/inputs/a2573ff52c4b06861bd019158f7ebda5aa70741b82b7bb20663d8ae07516de6b/summary.json","status":"corrected_rechecked","task_complete":false,"turn":"2"},{"action":"continue_original","episode":"C","episode_counts":{"correction":0,"judgment":1,"organize":0,"total":1},"final_text":"就这个最小实现及其“传递格式要求”的限定功能而言，可以完整理解为固定提示词注入；这不保证模型一定遵守格式，也不能定义所有其他Skills。","reason":null,"scope_acceptance":null,"source_ref":"/srv/agentdock/tmp/mindthus-relationship-D3-repair-r3/episodes/C/turns/391552c099c101b131feaf24c5795a6a15bc8ec82015424e0d2b4274a369a0bf/inputs/a344908a0a66d86a6fb89e89780a9d1613671b281110ecf8d406004a8e3a1a84/summary.json","status":"assessment_complete","task_complete":false,"turn":"1"},{"action":"continue_original","episode":"D","episode_counts":{"correction":1,"judgment":2,"organize":1,"total":4},"final_text":"就楼主当前“已有4K、暂不换显示器，字号难用”的困扰而言，momo的缩放办法是有作用的：所给操作记录显示，设置缩放后字号与配置达到了当事人可接受的程度，因此它直接针对了当前困扰。4K物理像素不等于5K、缩放未消除物理像素密度差异，这一点成立，但它回答的不是楼主此刻在问的问题；它至多是说明这条回复的边界，而不是否定其对当前困扰的解决作用。","reason":null,"scope_acceptance":true,"source_ref":"/srv/agentdock/tmp/mindthus-relationship-D3-repair-r3/episodes/D/turns/391552c099c101b131feaf24c5795a6a15bc8ec82015424e0d2b4274a369a0bf/inputs/b5ad8f85b45cf230086e1bea5c2980d157b3b1c39fc954846fc2ca8d6c1cc13c/summary.json","status":"corrected_rechecked","task_complete":false,"turn":"1"}],"sampling":"exposed_development_repair_R3_not_holdout; R2 E retained as valid wrong-mapping evidence, F failed expectation retained","schema":"mindthus.relationship-D3-observation.v1","source_commit":"09e08351162549dd3fe93bddf2ae5ca9967b880c","stop":null},"schema":"mindthus.decision-record.v1","sha256":"a8b708c8bc07da250d82b9c56a7969fc1f1b12329b26306a3ba2a64be40116c0"}
